          "briefTitle": "EOCRCPred: an AI Model to Predict Survival in EOCRC Patients After Surgery",
          "officialTitle": "EOCRCPred: an AI Model for Predicting Overall Survival in Early-Onset Stage I-III Colorectal Cancer Patients Post-Radical Resection-A SEER Database and Dual-Center Chinese Medical Institutions Study"
        },
